'''SOL DAE ROKKER''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that is found in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = SOL DAE ROKKER
|image = E 675.png
|first appearance = [[METAL SLUG STRIKES!]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
While this enemy may not seem like a threat with its relatively weak attacks and somewhat low health, on top of its [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] trait, it is extremely buffed in later stages, reaching up to 2,400,000 health and 60,000 damage per hit.

==Strategy==
''See [[METAL SLUG STRIKES!/MISSION 1~10]].''

